==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.33~1.33 seconds<sup>10f~40f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use multiple cheap meatshields to stall against the enemies. Use [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] to take out both the Doge Darks and Mooth.

